<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE CLOSING: VOLUME HIGHER, MOST STOCKS LOWER.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLOSING: VOLUME HIGHER, MOST STOCKS LOWER.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Preliminary data from the Estonian bourse on Tuesday put</p>
<p>total trade at 31.1 million kroons versus 22.6 million kroons</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>* The Talse online index lost 1.47 percent to close at</p>
<p>246.54. (See index on stock exchange web site:</p>
<p>http://www.tse.ee/online/total.htm)</p>
<p>* Preliminary closing data put Hansapank 2.05</p>
<p>kroons lower at 125.05 kroons with a volume of 9.4 million</p>
<p>kroons.</p>
</text>
